ovable immediately legible. Partner with SAs at these companies on active opportunities to move deals forward and feeding technical pipeline intelligence back to the alliance lead. Technical Support & Enablement Resolve blockers for partner SAs working on Supabase implementations to maintain their credibility with the builders they support. Troubleshoot complex integration scenarios and turn solutions into reusable assets. Maintain a close feedback loop with Supabase product and engineering teams to ensure technical guidance reflects the latest platform capabilities. Measure success through co-sell opportunities sourced, influenced deals, and SA enablement metrics across the Anthropic, OpenAI, Vercel, and Lovable partnerships. Content Creation & Thought Leadership Write technical blog posts and case studies that demonstrate real-world Supabase implementations built on Anthropic, OpenAI, Vercel, and Lovable. Represent Supabase at conferences, meetups, and partner-sponsored events (e.g. Anthropic and OpenAI dev days, Vercel Ship, Lovable community events). Develop video content and interactive learning experiences to reduce the \"time-to-fluency\" for partner SAs. You Might Be a Good Fit If You Have 5+ years of experience in technical roles with deep hands-on experience building on modern AI infrastructure. Previous experience working at Anthropic, OpenAI, Vercel, Lovable (or a similar AI builder platform) or as a partner to one is required. Understand how partner SAs at AI builder platforms are incentivized, how they make recommendations, and how the partner ecosystem influences developer decisions. Communicate clearly across both technical and non-technical audiences, explaining complex concepts with ease. Have a strong technical foundation in PostgreSQL, APIs, and modern development frameworks like React and Next.js, plus fluency with AI/agent tooling (LLM APIs, MCP, agent frameworks). Are comfortable navigating ambiguity and moving quickly to build a playbook from