ent this way will be much better. P.S. AI mentioned you may be too worried about privacy(personally I don&#x27;t mind it roughly speaking about myself), so may you suggest any alternatives&#x2F;trade-offs? --- * We may also add weights to voices * Also, this is a good place for suggesting your dreams about the perfect world. ** Also, we may just boycott a lot of US military this way and economize a lot of money for much more useful purposes",
